T*
(\(continuous line thickness\).) Tj
T*
(* Vertical Gothic: Upright capital letters perpendicular to the baseline.) Tj
T*
(Height-to-width ratio typically 7:5 \(except W=7:7, I=7:1\).) Tj
T*
