T*
(length 40 mm placed 8 mm below bottom edge \(staggered to avoid crossing\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. Diametral Dimensions: External diameter indicated as dia 60 \(symbol circle with) Tj
T*
(slash\) placed outside the view. Inner bore indicated with leader line and callout:) Tj
T*
(dia 30 THRU.) Tj
