(* 4. Arrowheads: Drawn with 3:1 aspect ratio, sharp point touching extension line,) Tj
T*
(completely blackened.) Tj
T*
(* 5. Text Alignment: Numerals 90, 40, 60 placed horizontally in gaps cut into) Tj
T*
(dimension lines as per unidirectional standards.) Tj
